{% if contextualize %}
Plan the first evaluation-library search for the latest user question. Use previous turns to resolve references and
carry forward the relevant intervention, outcome or other constraints. For a new topic, use the latest question on its own.
Treat prior answers as context and verify findings against the evidence. Write one standalone search using concrete
